{"4138820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wreckborn", "steam_appid": 4138820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/35e4c7a9d897a870bbc78fb0353cfd34.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1489 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreckborn is a combination of survival, base building, exploration, and combat in space. This single-player science fiction game offers gameplay in a procedurally generated open world full of asteroids, wrecks, and clashes with space pirates. Your goal is to survive, develop your colony, and build infrastructure in the unforgiving cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step by step, reclaim control over the system that space pirates have claimed as their own.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a base on an asteroid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small outpost and expand it into a powerful space fortress.<br>Building new structures allows you to create an extensive industrial and defensive backbone.<br>Construct generators, habitats, factories, mines, and defense systems.<br>Each new structure strengthens your colony and opens up new opportunities for expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/c00b3bcb2144685596f046c4725e354b.poster.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/c00b3bcb2144685596f046c4725e354b.webm?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/c00b3bcb2144685596f046c4725e354b.mp4?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine, produce, and manage resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must not only gather resources, but also manage them wisely.<br>Crafting, production automation, and effective resource management will allow you to create increasingly advanced structures, systems, and spacecraft.<br>Over time, you can build a self-sufficient production network that supports further colonization and the growth of your base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore dangerous space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through space to discover new technologies, abandoned wrecks, deserted installations, and rare resources.<br>Each expedition is a chance to obtain valuable resources, but also carries the risk of encountering hostile units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/df607119467b687f7706bb86b78258c8.poster.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/df607119467b687f7706bb86b78258c8.webm?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/df607119467b687f7706bb86b78258c8.mp4?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Establish colonies on new asteroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not limit yourself to a single base.<br>Build new mining outposts on additional asteroids and create a network of connected colonies that provide valuable resources and support further development.<br>Each new location increases your possibilities, but also exposes you to new dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight pirates and defend your base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirates will constantly threaten your colony, disrupt its development, and try to destroy everything you have built.<br>Place defensive towers, reinforce key points, and design your base layout in a way that makes it as difficult as possible for the enemy to destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/13d2149c4c418f84654f7bc6d4e62dea.poster.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/13d2149c4c418f84654f7bc6d4e62dea.webm?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/13d2149c4c418f84654f7bc6d4e62dea.mp4?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sandbox and space simulator elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >base building on asteroids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >resource extraction, crafting, and production automation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >defending colonies against pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploration and salvaging resources from wrecks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space flight, fleet development, and spacecraft combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light survival experience in space focused on freedom, base building, and dynamic space battles.<br>Explore, expand, and fight — step by step reclaim control over the system that pirates have claimed as their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is still in active development — bugs or technical issues may occur and will be fixed in future updates. Thank you for your feedback and support!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/35e4c7a9d897a870bbc78fb0353cfd34.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1489 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreckborn is a combination of survival, base building, exploration, and combat in space. This single-player science fiction game offers gameplay in a procedurally generated open world full of asteroids, wrecks, and clashes with space pirates. Your goal is to survive, develop your colony, and build infrastructure in the unforgiving cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step by step, reclaim control over the system that space pirates have claimed as their own.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a base on an asteroid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small outpost and expand it into a powerful space fortress.<br>Building new structures allows you to create an extensive industrial and defensive backbone.<br>Construct generators, habitats, factories, mines, and defense systems.<br>Each new structure strengthens your colony and opens up new opportunities for expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/c00b3bcb2144685596f046c4725e354b.poster.avif?t=1786553011\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/extras/c00b3bcb2144685596f046c4725e354b.webm?t=1786553011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati